e  Soul Society material I thought for the  first time in the series the secondary  Supporting Cast ended up contributing to  this Arc in such a compelling and  meaningful fashion for without the likes  of Urdu and Rukia coming to their  friends's aid to turn the tides and make  brilliant reveals or Chad and Orihime  helping Ichigo train and eventually  facilitate my favorite portion of the  story through their zombification this  story simply wouldn't have worked even  in the slightest fulbring is my antidote  to how the aranca arc made me feel and  my guess is that the anime much like how  I've noticed it did with other arcs it  may have done the same game with the  full brain that being either changed the  arc or inject so much filler that it  ruins the arc and for that reason I  cannot stress how wonderful and easy a  read it is in the manga at just 58  chapters in length it has something for  everyone I think it is for these reasons  and many more that I can safely say that  the fulbring Arc of bleach gets the  totally not marked thumbs up of approval  and so far it's the best archive red and  bleach comfortably it takes far more  risks and assumes a much less  conventional structure than I felt the  sole Society Arc did it delivers a much  more focused story than substitute  Shinigami and it is exactly as long as  it needs to be unlike the aranka rack to  me it's easily the best our Kubo has  penned and it's not even close  [Applause]  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  another place  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]
 

